OL,3,GNEWSABirmingham Airport expansion 'can
OL,4,Aonly be a good thing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to expand Birmingham Airport have
OL,7,Fprompted a mixed reaction from
OL,8,Fresidents and business leaders.
OL,10,FThe airport has unveiled a #2bn plan
OL,11,Fwhich could more than double passenger
OL,12,Fnumbers to 30 million and create more
OL,13,Fthan 50,000 jobs.
OL,15,FWhile some people who live under flight
OL,16,Fpaths near the airport have questioned
OL,17,Fthe impact of future growth on local
OL,18,Fcommunities, business groups have
OL,19,Fwelcomed the plans as a boost for the
OL,20,FWest Midlands.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
