OL,3,GNEWSABirmingham Airport expansion 'can
OL,4,Aonly be a good thing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRaj Kandola, deputy chief executive of
OL,7,Fthe Greater Birmingham Chambers of
OL,8,FCommerce, told BBC Radio WM the plans
OL,9,Fwere a "massive vote of confidence" for
OL,10,Fthe region.
